source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A backslash written as a character reference is body content rather than a run in front of the closer, so the span forms and its last character is a backslash; this is the form jiro's writer emits for inline code ending in a backslash.
-- input.jira --
{{a&#92;}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a&#92;</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\`
-- warnings.json --
[]
